  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communicating the Resilient Syunik - Team Europe Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Provide a special coverage of the projects implemented within the scope of Resilient Syunik-Team Europe Initiative. The general aim of the contract is to increase both Team Europe and the EU visibility. The coverage shall promote a better understanding of Resilient Syunik-Team Europe Initiative of the EU. The communication shall be made through success stories behind the initiative in English and Armenian, ensuring their wide dissemination via available social and digital portals. The stories can include photos and infographics, and be prepared in various forms: texts, interviews, photo and video stories, etc. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
